Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: RimPulse contributors <rimpulse@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ArliT1-F/RimPulse
Description: RimWorld mod development environment
 Build. Reload. Test. Repeat. RimPulse manages RimWorld installations,
 compiles mod projects against the selected game's real assemblies and
 launches a managed development session. It is a companion tool, not an
 IDE or a game, and still requires a RimWorld 1.6 or 1.7 installation.
